  "card": "Prevents cached block validation flags from persisting across different consensus parameters in the libbitcoinkernel C API. Because `btck_Block` wraps a shared `CBlock`, running block validation caches `fChecked` on the underlying object, causing later checks against different chain parameters (such as testing a regtest block against mainnet rules, or processing blocks across different signet challenges) to erroneously pass. The PR makes `btck_block_check` and `btck_chainstate_manager_process_block` validate against an unfagged copy of the block sharing the transaction pointers. Two reproduction test cases are added in `test_kernel.cpp`.",
